{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1440706-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition-enters-3rd-printing","id":1440706,"title":"Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition enters 3rd printing","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-20T04:21:38-07:00","id":1440706,"title":"Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition enters 3rd printing","content":"<a href=\"https://icv2.com/articles/news/view/47866/renegade-game-studios-printings-vampire-the-masquerade-5e-books-headed-retail?fbclid=IwAR35E4pV4DEZvvN4u7DI0mfCOPbzu4gADvAUdSJoVO_ZWvupgaJWt6r9wtk\" target=\"_blank\">https://icv2.com/articles/news/view/47866/renegade-game-studios-printings-vampire-the-masquerade-5e-books-headed-retail</a><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Renegade Game Studios will release reprinted editions of <i>Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition Roleplaying Game</i> core rulebook and sourcebooks into retail in July.</b><br /> <br /> <i>Set in the World of Darkness, Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition is a game of personal and political horror. Players enter the world as vampires, struggling for survival and supremacy all while trying to hold on to the last of their fading humanity. The book is a reprint of the previous version, includes a satin ribbon bookmark, and will retail for $55.</i><br /> <br /> <i>The Vampire: The Masquerade Anarch Sourcebook dives into the the Anarch Movement who have enjoyed an uneasy truce with the Camarilla. The Anarchs now claim the nighttime streets as their own, and only the toughest and smartest of self-made vampires will survive. The Anarch Sourcebook contains stories and metaplot for the Anarch Movement in modern times, with lore sheets and histories for added gameplay experiences. The book also includes rulesets and lore for the Ministry clan, formerly known as Followers of Set. The 200-page, full-color hardcover book will retail for $50 when it releases.</i><br /> <br /> <i>Vampire: The Masquerade Camarilla Sourcebook focuses on the Camarilla faction, the once stronghold of immortality and the mightiest faction of vampires in the world. The faction now retreats as it attempts to enforce the Masquerade in the face of modern technology while protecting itself from the threat of the Second Inquisition. The Camarilla Sourcebook contains all the information on the powerful faction\u2019s place in the modern world and the clans within the Camarilla, including Banu Haqim (formally known as the Assamites) and Ashirra.<br /> <br /> The sourcebook provides new antagonists for players with the introduction of the Second Inquisition. The book also includes new rituals, lore sheets, and faction histories for added gameplay experiences.The 200-page, full-color hardcover book will retail for $50 when it releases.</i> Renegade Game Studios was named a publishing partner for the Word of Darkness brand in November (see \u201c<a href=\"https://icv2.com/articles/news/view/46956/renegade-game-studios-becomes-ttrpg-publishing-partner-world-darkness\" target=\"_blank\">Renegade Game Studios Becomes a TTRPG Publishing Partner for \u2018World of Darkness\u2019</a>\u201d).</span><br /> <br /> Congratulations to White Wolf and Paradox for this!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-20-2021, 07:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-20T08:27:16-07:00","id":1440723,"title":"","content":"Wonderful News!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-20T10:28:16-07:00","id":1440733,"title":"","content":"Just bought the Camarilla book in PDF. Thanks for reminding me \ud83d\ude0a.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachm